    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kumugi go Tesaronike",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhoono hano wanyoorrë bhahetërë Ambibheri na Abhoronia, bhakahika Tesaronike, harë isinagogi ya Abhayahuti yaarëngë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhauro agasoha mo, keebhörë yaarëngë ësëëra yaae, na kumikubhiö ëtatö agakarëna nabho kurua kö Amandëko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arateebherria na köherekia iga ngeeisainë iga Kirisitö airiire sooki ariööke kurua köbhaku, na aragamba iga, “Yesö, öno nkurundia harë bhainyu, nëwe Kirisitö.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhamui bhaabho mbaarööchë iga na amaheene bhagaitabhërrania na Bhauro na Sira; hamui na irikomo irinene ria Abhagiriki, hamui na abhagaikörö abhaamë abhaaru abhë ësööko bhano bhaarëngë abhasengeri bhë Ënooköë.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono Abhayahuti mbaabhaayë na irihari, köhayö bhagaköma abhantö amarënchëgë kurua guchimberi bhakabha irikomo. Bhagakora umugi gonsui gökahërra na bhagasoherra umugi gö ömöntö öno aarë köbhërëkëroa iga Yasoni, bharasaacha kurigia Bhauro na Sira korri iga bhabharichoki këbhara köbhantö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono hano bhaangërë köbhanyoora, mbaang'uurrë Yasoni hamui na abhakumia bhandë, bhakabhahira köbhanene bhu umugi bharachëërra iga, “Abhantö bhano bhaanturukania ëkëbhara bhahikërë hano guiki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Yasoni abhairigaini waae. Bhonsui ngösaria bharë imigiro ge Kaisari bharagamba iga ömögambi wöndë naaho iga Yesö.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kömang'ana gayö bhagachuuria abhatangati hamui na irikomo rionsui ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na abhatangati bhu umugi bhakaimukia ëkëgooterro kurua harë bhaabho Yasoni, hakurua bhakabhahaatëra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kumugi go Bheroya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano bhoirë, abhakumia mbaahirrë Bhauro na Sira Bheroya. Hano bhaahikërë ho, mbaagëëyë gusinagoogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bha Bheroya bho mbaramuku bhaarëngë, tëbhanga bhaara bha Tesaronike hai. Bho mbaategerreeyë amang'ana gayö bhaana inyonta, na ruiso ronsui mbaarëngë guisuncha Amandëko korri iga bhöngöre amang'ana gano Bhauro aarë kögamba nyoore maheene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaaru bha Abhayahuti mbaakumiri amang'ana gayö; hamui na abhagaikörö bhi Ikigiriki, na abhasaacha Abhagiriki nabho bhonsui mbaakumiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono hano Abhayahuti bha Tesaronike bhaiguurë iga Bhauro arundiri ëng'ana yë Ënooköë Bheroya na ho guiki, mbaagëëyë ho gösëëga abhantö bhaaho, bharabhachimia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhöngöbhöngö igo abhakumia bhaara bhakahira Bhauro nyancha; sibhoono Sira na Timoteo bho mbaatamërë Bheroya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bhaara bhaaröngëkërë Bhauro mbaageenainë bhakahika Atene, hakurua bhakaringa kuya Bheroya bhakaherra Sira na Timoteo ëngamba iga, Bhauro nköbhatuna arë bhöngöbhöngö iga bhayi harë we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kumugi go Atene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano wanyoorrë Bhauro akëëganya Sira na Timoteo Atene haara, naarirriibhui bhökong'u, hano aarööchë möna umugi göyö wanyoorrë goichöra ibhihooru bhi ichinooköë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö agakora isumaacho na Abhayahuti hamui na Abhagiriki bhano bhaagasengeeyë Ënooköë, gu isinagogi, ruiso ronsui naarë gusumaacha na abhantö kömötëëra, bhano waakanyoorrë bharaheta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaigia Abhaebhikureo na Abhasitoiko nabho bhonsui mbaahunchukiraini nawe. Abhamui bhaabho bhakabhuuria iga, “Ömöntö ömökangi öno nkë akögamba?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhandë bhakahunchukia iga, “Nkömaahëkana arë nkanya ngusumaachëra arë ichinoököë ichingeni.” Mbaagambërë igo, kugira Bhauro naarë göteebherria igörö ya Yesö, na igörö yu ukuriööka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö mbaaimukiri Bhauro bhakamuhira köbharasa yu umugi ëno ëköbhërëkëröa iga Areobhago, bhakagamba iga, “Tökahanchërë iga tömanye amaigiö amageni gano warentërë kuigia hano ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kugira amang'ana agamui gano ukuigia na amageni harë bhaitö, ntöhanchërë iga tömanye ësësöro yaago.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kugira abhaibhörröa bha Atene bhonsui hamui na abhaitongo bhano bhamenyërë Atene, ruiso ronsui tëbhaagakorrë yëndë hai ëtarë iga mbaakahanchërë gusumaacha na götegeerra amang'ana amahëa.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhauro akaimëërra mbere yi ëbharasa ëyö ya Areobhago aragamba iga, “Bharë bhantö bha Atene! Ndööchë iga guchiteemo cheinyu chonsui mmörëngë abhantö bhi itiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Öbh 13:1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kugira keebhörë naarë kuinaaranaara kumugi goinyu göno harë honsui mukuya gösengera, nkanyoora irikëngë rëno rendëkëröë iga, ‘Kö Ënooköë öno atamanyëkainë.’ Öyö mögösengera mötasësööyë iga nëwe ng'ui, nëwe mbe nköbhateebherria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.8.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Gam 8:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.42.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 42:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.48"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ama 7:48",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ënooköë, öno aateemërë ëkëbhara hamui na bhino bhionsui bhiimo, nëwe Ömönene wa igörö na hansë, na takömenya kuhinyumba hiö öbhösa hino hikorröë na amabhoko ga abhantö hai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
